SUMMARY:2026 CareOregon Grand Floral Starlight Parade
DESCRIPTION:In 2026\, the Portland Rose Festival proudly introduces an exciting evolution of two beloved traditions: the CareOregon Grand Floral Starlight Parade. \nThis newly reimagined parade brings together the pageantry of the Grand Floral Parade with the energy and excitement of the Starlight Parade into one unforgettable celebration. By combining these iconic events\, the Rose Festival is creating a single\, dynamic parade experience that honors tradition while embracing creativity\, community\, and innovation. \nFor more information\, CLICK HERE.
URL:https://www.thesquarepdx.org/event/2026-careoregon-grand-floral-starlight-parade/
LOCATION:OR
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.thesquarepdx.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/CareOregonGrandFloralStarlightParade-Logo.jpg
END:VEVENT
