SUMMARY:Noon Tunes Summer Concert Series
DESCRIPTION:Hannah Glavor will be performing at Noon Tunes over the lunch hour! Hannah Glavor is a Portland based singer-songwriter with a cinematic range of indie rock revelry and raw folk spirit\, clutched together by catching pop elements. She has been on the West Coast scene for the past decade sharing the stage and with a broad range of sound like Elbow\, Joseph\, Y La Bamba\, and Sixpence None the Richer. Her songs and mantra have not ceased to strive to give language to hope; having weathered losses\, difficult transitions\, and surviving a brain tumor at 30. Her cry for peace and hope\, even in the worst of life’s storms\, is an invitation for all to fight to see and love others around them. \nThe Noon Tunes Summer Concert Series returns to The Square for its 34th year on Tuesdays and Thursdays June 2 – July 30! From Noon-1:00pm enjoy a dynamic mix of homegrown music from some of Portland’s top regional and local musical talent. With 18 FREE concerts\, dancing\, painting at Art in The Park and some of Portland’s favorite food vendors at Carts on the Square\, The Square is Downtown’s summer lunchtime destination. \nUpcoming Concerts: \nJune 16th – Reisender\nJune 18th – Kyle Glenn & The Wandering Kind\nJune 23rd – Eric John Kaiser\nJune 25th – Burnt Citrus\nJune 30th – Alisa Stewart\nJuly 2nd – LINOY\nJuly 7th – JT Wise Band\nJuly 9th – Mitch And The Melody Makers\nJuly 14th – Sherbet Tone\nJuly 16th – Rose Gerber\nJuly 21st – The AM (Acoustic Minds)\nJuly 23rd – Castletown\nJuly 28th – Fox and Bones\nJuly 30th – John Thayer Music
URL:https://www.thesquarepdx.org/event/noon-tunes-summer-concert-series-5-2026-06-11/
LOCATION:Pioneer Courthouse Square\, 701 SW 6th Ave.\, Portland\, OR\, 97204\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.thesquarepdx.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/HannahGlavor_2023_FLOWERS.jpg
END:VEVENT
