SUMMARY:Noon Tunes Summer Concert Series
DESCRIPTION:LINOY will be performing at Noon Tunes over the lunch hour! LINOY is a Portland-based singer-songwriter blending emotional storytelling\, soulful vocals\, and bold alt-pop energy. Often described as “if Chappell Roan and Norah Jones had a musical baby\,” LINOY’s full-band performances move between intimate\, dreamy moments and playful\, high-energy releases. With a haunting voice\, magnetic stage presence\, and songs that invite audiences to both feel deeply and sing along\, LINOY creates a live show that is warm\, theatrical\, and deeply human. \nThe Noon Tunes Summer Concert Series returns to The Square for its 34th year on Tuesdays and Thursdays June 2 – July 30! From Noon-1:00pm enjoy a dynamic mix of homegrown music from some of Portland’s top regional and local musical talent. With 18 FREE concerts\, dancing\, painting at Art in The Park and some of Portland’s favorite food vendors at Carts on the Square\, The Square is Downtown’s summer lunchtime destination. \nUpcoming Concerts: \nJuly 7th – JT Wise Band\nJuly 9th – Mitch And The Melody Makers\nJuly 14th – Sherbet Tone\nJuly 16th – Rose Gerber\nJuly 21st – The AM (Acoustic Minds)\nJuly 23rd – Castletown\nJuly 28th – Fox and Bones\nJuly 30th – John Thayer Music
URL:https://www.thesquarepdx.org/event/noon-tunes-summer-concert-series-5-2026-07-02/
LOCATION:Pioneer Courthouse Square\, 701 SW 6th Ave.\, Portland\, OR\, 97204\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.thesquarepdx.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LINOY_AVODAZARAH.jpeg
END:VEVENT
